     3084         b1-gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3085         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3086                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3087                   end.
     3088      when "b2":u  then  do:
     3089       DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
