     3102         b2-gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3103         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3104                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3105                 end.
     3106      when "bi":u then  do:
     3107       DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
     3108         p3 @ s-bar-code
     3109         p4 @ gds-zap-artic
     3110         p5 @ gds-zap-gds-name
     3111         p6 @ gds-zap-unit-base
     3112         p1 @ gds-type
     3113         bi-ostatok-start [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" @  F-ostatok-start
     3114         bi-Prih          [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" @  F-Prih
     3115         bi-RAsh          [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" @  F-RAsh
