     3139         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3140                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3141                 end.
     3142      when ""  then  do:
     3143       DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
     3144         p3 @ s-bar-code
