     3156         gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3157         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3158                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3159                 end.
     3160      end case.
